      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_MATERIAL_LIGHT has the value 7</p>
  <p>This constant and it&#39;s underlying functionality is deprecated.</p>
  <p>Light is no longer a prim property, it is now a face property. The same functionality is reproduced with `[ [PRIM_FULLBRIGHT](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_FULLBRIGHT), [ALL_SIDES](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES), [TRUE](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE) ]`</p>
</p>
